                "description": "Prop name: tree, pine, house, sun, cloud, moon, star, planet, rocket, car, boat, plane, apple, book, lightbulb, coin, money, heart, flower, mountain, fish, cup, clock, globe, gift, trophy, cake, laptop, drop, leaf, flame, bolt, bread, carrot, pizza, battery, magnet, phone, tooth — or any icon name (becomes a paper sticker)."
